<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπά̆δ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπάς</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small torch</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπάδια
				ἔχοντες διαδώσουσιν ἀλλήλοις</span>, of the torch-race,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				328a
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπάς</span> (A) <i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβὼν στέφανον . . καὶ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bowl</i> of a lamp, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				38.16
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				37.19
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Za.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lint</i> for wounds, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				68.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>top-knot</i>, coiffure of Theban women, <i><span class="en">
				Dicaearch.
				1.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> kind of comic
			mask, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.151
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				154
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
